WEBVTT

NOTE CineReels — The Last Message — Episode 5 — English subtitles (PRIMARY dialogue, language: en)

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:06.000
Mama sent me the same message… but in a different voice. A laughing voice.

2
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Sara… Layla… if you're hearing this together, then my plan worked.

3
00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:19.000
You are my family… both of you. Not just one.

4
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:26.000
The old house is not for sale… the house is for both of you.

5
00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:31.000
She planned all of this… a year ago.

6
00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:37.000
She knew we'd find each other… even if she wasn't here.

7
00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:42.000
The photo… if we put the two halves together…

8
00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:47.000
It's whole. Just like us.

9
00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:53.000
I'm sorry… I'm sorry to both of you.

10
00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:58.000
Your mother was the bravest of us all.

11
00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:04.000
Don't forget each other… ever.

12
00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:12.000
The last message… arrived.
